 for the desired-size system.\r\nTest cases were added for:\r\n* `Label` -> add height-based tests for auto-wrapping and trimming\r\n* `TabBar` -> add basic desired size tests\r\n* `BoxContainer`/`FlowContainer`/`GridContainer` -> add tests for handling children with a desired size greater than their minimum size\r\n\r\nA new `MockControl` class is added for testing use only, which allows devs to customize the computed minimum size and computed desired size to set values instead.\r\n\r\nWith these tests, the fragile parts of the desired size system should now be tracked for regressions.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAI usage: I designed the majority of it, though AI was used to speed up some of the boring work (e.g., copying the `HBoxContainer` tests into `VBoxContainer`). All AI work was reviewed and tested <sub>(duh... they're unit tests)</sub>. \r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2231593685,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjMxNTkzNjg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:tests","name":"topic:tests","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky